{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\NcNetherrack\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "openapi-drift",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "PUT /ocs/v2.php/apps/nc_netherrack/api/v1/admin/speech-recognition  OCA\\NcNetherrack\\Controller\\SettingsController::setSpeechRecognition(): not in openapi.json",
        "GET /ocs/v2.php/apps/nc_netherrack/api/v1/admin/voice-status  OCA\\NcNetherrack\\Controller\\SettingsController::getVoiceStatus(): not in openapi.json",
        "PUT /ocs/v2.php/apps/nc_netherrack/api/v1/admin/voice-config  OCA\\NcNetherrack\\Controller\\SettingsController::setVoiceConfig(): not in openapi.json"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "The OpenAPI specification and the routes differ in 3 operations. A client generated from the specification then calls what is not there, or lacks what is. This holds the routes against the specification and does not generate it again.",
        "  PUT /ocs/v2.php/apps/nc_netherrack/api/v1/admin/speech-recognition  OCA\\NcNetherrack\\Controller\\SettingsController::setSpeechRecognition(): not in openapi.json",
        "  GET /ocs/v2.php/apps/nc_netherrack/api/v1/admin/voice-status  OCA\\NcNetherrack\\Controller\\SettingsController::getVoiceStatus(): not in openapi.json",
        "  PUT /ocs/v2.php/apps/nc_netherrack/api/v1/admin/voice-config  OCA\\NcNetherrack\\Controller\\SettingsController::setVoiceConfig(): not in openapi.json"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-tools-in-root",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "phpunit/phpunit is in require-dev of composer.json. The manual recommends a vendor-bin/ of bamarni/composer-bin-plugin per tool, so that the dependencies of a tool cannot conflict with those of the app."
      ]
